        "retry-rule": {
          "text": "Value.WaitFor re-invokes the producer only when the previous result is null (line 42-43). The GetRecords producer (lines 58-68) returns a Csv.Document table and never null, so no HTTP status code triggers a resend in practice. The delay is 2^iteration seconds (line 69), and the maximum attempts come from max_retry, loaded from WebApp.json (lines 24, 69). No status codes are named for retry. throttle_limit (line 25) is loaded but never used, so there is no rate-limit handling.",
